on who loves to collect souls in her lantern! \nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/10UGJyq9nKCsWrvKj-bn-vV_1r9xukxEA/view?usp=sharing\n\nPlease \n- make it 16:9 dimension\n- make it similar to your two drawings (the light is really cool!)\n- make the facial expression neutral with slight smile\n- separate the background from the character in a psd if possible\n- include a few souls in the background if possible\n\nThank you for considering my request!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/10UGJyq9nKCsWrvKj-bn-vV_1r9xukxEA/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tyabasirak/works/99", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8f8b00c3/uploads/origins/663b7707-99a0-40eb-9c5e-ad648e049d73?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5d9820f387934e6ef63115824b6d0be8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8f8b00c3/uploads/origins/663b7707-99a0-40eb-9c5e-ad648e049d73?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5d9820f387934e6ef63115824b6d0be8, https://si.imgix.net/8f8b00c3/uploads/origins/663b7707-99a0-40eb-9c5e-ad648e049d73?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=efb78899476ec9ed8f25547075461f77 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8f8b00c3/uploads/origins/663b7707-99a0-40eb-9c5e-ad648e049d73?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c5f6e1e5ff7278ef1adc1104ee37433e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！\n漫画「怪物王女」「南Q阿伝」に登場する南久阿（なくあ）というキャラクターを描いて頂けないでしょうか。\n服装は黒色のセーラー服でお願いします。\n表情は目つき鋭い無表情で、少し怖そうな雰囲気が希望です。\n\nよろしければ、お願いいたします！\n\nhttps://imgur.com/n8MPWxA", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tyabasirak/works/98", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a66071c7/uploads/origins/e1038427-69d7-4d80-aced-1efa084a4396?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ffa02fb13d10af07786ac4072f60ff55", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a66071c7/uploads/origins/e1038427-69d7-4d8